<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Insurance Auto cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Insurance Auto cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber has cut its rating for Insurance Auto Auctions Inc to neutral from buy, a source at the brokerage said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Palatine, Ill., company closed on Friday at 7-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
